(version 1)
; Run the AgentLandIroh tests under this profile (see README.md). It refuses UDP to
; the ports of router port mapping, for IPv4, IPv6 and multicast alike: UPnP discovery
; (SSDP, 1900), NAT-PMP and PCP (5351) and their announcements (5350). Nothing a test
; process does can then ask the router for a mapping. Everything else is allowed.
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound (remote udp "*:1900"))
(deny network-outbound (remote udp "*:5350"))
(deny network-outbound (remote udp "*:5351"))
